{"questions":[{"question_id":"5pH25xJQ6F1NJ5Kz","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2013 (Offline)","year":2013,"examDate":2013,"subject":"chemistry","chapter":"thermodynamics","chapterGroup":"physical-chemistry","topic":"first-law-of-thermodynamics","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"permalink":"a-piston-filled-with-004-mol-of-an-ideal-gas-expands-revers-2013-marks-4-5ph25xjq6f1nj5kz.htm","content":"A piston filled with 0.04 mol of an ideal gas expands reversibly from 50.0 mL to 375 mL at a constant\ntemperature of 37.0<sup>o</sup>C. As it does so, it absorbs 208J of heat. The values of q and w for the process will be :<br>\n(R = 8.314 J/mol K) ( l n 7.5 = 2.01)","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"q = – 208 J, w = – 208 J "},{"identifier":"B","content":"q = – 208 J, w = + 208 J"},{"identifier":"C","content":"q = + 208 J, w = + 208 J"},{"identifier":"D","content":"q = + 208 J, w = – 208 J "}],"correct_options":["D"],"explanation":"By I<sup>st</sup>\n law of thermodynamics, q = <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.885ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 833 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>E – W\n<br><br>At const T, ∆E = 0\n<br><br> q = – W\n<br><br> Heat absorbed = 208 J\n<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> q = +208 J\n<br><br> W = – 208 J "}]}